## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/scroll-area.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { ScrollArea } from "@coss-sv/ui";
</script>

<ScrollArea class="h-64 rounded-md border">
  <div class="p-4">Long content...</div>
</ScrollArea>
```

## API Reference

### ScrollArea

Styled composition of the Shards Scroll Area parts with COSS scrollbar styling.

| Prop                   | Type      | Default | Description                                                  |
| ---------------------- | --------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `scrollFade`           | `boolean` | `false` | Masks overflowing viewport edges.                            |
| `scrollbarGutter`      | `boolean` | `false` | Reserves space for visible scrollbars.                       |
| `fill`                 | `boolean` | `false` | Makes the content wrapper fill the viewport.                 |
| `clampContentMinWidth` | `boolean` | `true`  | Prevents unintended horizontal overflow in vertical layouts. |
| `overscrollContain`    | `boolean` | `false` | Stops scroll chaining into parent scrollers.                 |

See the [Shards Scroll Area API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/scroll-area) for primitive part props.

