### Fill viewport (flex layouts)

Use `fill` when the scroll area wraps a flex column that should stretch to the full viewport height.

```svelte
<ScrollArea class="min-h-0 flex-1" fill>
  <div class="flex h-full flex-col">
    <nav>Main items</nav>
    <footer class="mt-auto">Pinned footer</footer>
  </div>
</ScrollArea>
```

### Overscroll contain

Use `overscrollContain` to stop wheel and touch scrolling from chaining into a parent scroller.
